# Repository-level attributes for the files outside the two projects (.specify scripts,
# .claude hooks, docs). Each project keeps its own .gitattributes (D-001).
# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and in working copies, so shell scripts
# behave the same on every host.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never normalised or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
